{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Rules of Nature",
    "steam_appid": 3759510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules of Nature</strong><br>An open-world post-apocalyptic survival game set in a zombie apocalypse. As one of the few survivors, you must explore towns to scavenge supplies, fend off zombie attacks, recruit survivors, and build your base. Survive!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather system</strong>: Rain, snow, thunderstorms, sandstorms, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-night cycle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC dialogue system</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ lootable items</strong>: Medical supplies, food, drinks, weapons, building materials, seeds, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat action system</strong>: Fist/melee attacks, executions, parry with defensive weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firearms</strong>: Pistols, submachine guns, rifles, shotguns, sniper rifles, suppressors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildings</strong>: Foundations, workbenches, warehouses, generators, wind/solar power, rainwater collectors, survivor camps, medical centers, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit survivors</strong>: Assign them to gather resources, explore with you, fight zombies, or guard your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your base</strong>: Decide locations, construction, resource allocation, and migration to safer zones.<br>Survival is your duty. <strong>Stay alive!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rules of Nature</strong><br>An open-world post-apocalyptic survival game set in a zombie apocalypse. As one of the few survivors, you must explore towns to scavenge supplies, fend off zombie attacks, recruit survivors, and build your base. Survive!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic weather system</strong>: Rain, snow, thunderstorms, sandstorms, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-night cycle</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC dialogue system</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ lootable items</strong>: Medical supplies, food, drinks, weapons, building materials, seeds, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat action system</strong>: Fist/melee attacks, executions, parry with defensive weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Firearms</strong>: Pistols, submachine guns, rifles, shotguns, sniper rifles, suppressors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildings</strong>: Foundations, workbenches, warehouses, generators, wind/solar power, rainwater collectors, survivor camps, medical centers, etc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Recruit survivors</strong>: Assign them to gather resources, explore with you, fight zombies, or guard your base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage your base</strong>: Decide locations, construction, resource allocation, and migration to safer zones.<br>Survival is your duty. <strong>Stay alive!</strong></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An open-world post-apocalyptic survival game set during a zombie outbreak. As one of the few survivors, you must explore towns to scavenge supplies, remain vigilant against zombie attacks, recruit fellow survivors, and build your survivor base. Stay alive!",
